\pard\sa120\sb120\fs28\b Description\b0{\*\bkmkstart description}{\*\bkmkend description}\par
\pard\sa80\fs22 Copies the correct WIP profile template to the live profile location (platform-aware: windowspsprofile.ps1 on Windows, psprofile.ps1 on Linux/macOS, vscodeprofile.ps1 for the VS Code profile), then injects the Automation module import block (with the machine-specific absolute path) into the live profile(s). Can be run from anywhere - uses the script's repo root as the base path.\par
